  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: X6
  Title: Two steps on one value at once
  Summary: Fight runs a Scale and a Punch Scale on Box at the same time. Fixed punches
    a child instead.
  Watch: Box, Fixed
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 246237113}
  - {fileID: 1156658173}
  HowTo: Play Fight, then Fixed, then Reset.
  Expect: 'Fight: the two steps overwrite each other - the growth stutters or the
    punch is lost, and the box doesn''t end cleanly at 1.5. Fixed: the box grows
    smoothly while its star punches.'
  Needs: 1
  Style: 0
