  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: X9
  Title: Every step type keeps its number
  Summary: A step saved with each type number from 0 to 20, in order. Unity stores
    the number, so the headers must still read these types.
  Watch: Numbers (inactive; holds the player)
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1618384376}
  HowTo: Select Numbers. Open Numbers 0 to 20 and read the type in brackets on each
    header, top to bottom. Warning signs on them are expected (Numbers has none of
    the components).
  Expect: 0 Anchored Position, 1 Canvas Group Alpha, 2 Graphic Alpha, 3 Graphic Color,
    4 Local Position, 5 Material Color, 6 Material Float, 7 Offset Min, 8 Offset
    Max, 9 Punch Anchored Position, 10 Punch Scale, 11 Rotation, 12 Scale, 13 Set
    Active, 14 Shake Anchored Position, 15 Size Delta, 16 Play Sound, 17 Punch Rotation,
    18 Shake Rotation, 19 Shake Scale, 20 Custom Property.
  Needs: 4
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 120
