  Code: X1
  Title: Warnings in play mode
  Summary: Broken has a Canvas Group step on a box with none, and a path to 'Boxx'.
    Its last step (a punch) is fine.
  Watch: Box
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1439377335}
  HowTo: Clear the Console. Enter play mode. Click Play Broken five times, then Play
    'Nope' twice.
  Expect: 'Each warning reads ''<who>: CONSEQUENCE IN CAPITALS. details'' and clicking
    it selects the tile. One warning for each broken step when the game starts -
    no more however often Broken plays - and the punch plays every time. Play ''Nope''
    warns that there''s no animation called Nope. Nothing throws.'
  Needs: 18
  Style: 0
